[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4371212394","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111506#issuecomment-4371212394","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111506","id":4371212394,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBItoag","user":{"login":"Naros","id":3255568,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTU1Njg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3255568?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros","html_url":"https://github.com/Naros","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-04T12:55:36Z","updated_at":"2026-05-04T12:56:50Z","body":"As a side note, I found an unusual oddity. The `add_named_global` is called from the editor, and only appears to fire for `ScriptLanguage` that are enabled early in the startup, which would be CSharp/GDScript only. It never fires for any language registered through GDExtension, unless a post-startup editor action triggers a refresh.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4371212394/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4377139594","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111506#issuecomment-4377139594","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111506","id":4377139594,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBOXZig","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-05T06:58:16Z","updated_at":"2026-05-05T06:58:16Z","body":"> As a side note, I found an unusual oddity. The `add_named_global` is called from the editor, and only appears to fire for `ScriptLanguage` that are enabled early in the startup, which would be CSharp/GDScript only. It never fires for any language registered through GDExtension, unless a post-startup editor action triggers a refresh.\r\n\r\nI'd suggest opening a separate issue about that.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4377139594/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5016255966","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111506#issuecomment-5016255966","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111506","id":5016255966,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKv393g","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-19T15:19:44Z","updated_at":"2026-07-19T15:19:44Z","body":"According to the discussion in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105319, yes they can.\r\n\r\nNot sure what you mean by the optimization part. This PR isn't about optimization. The globals array is meant to be stable. Doctoring around on it like this is just asking for edge case crashes, because there are no validity checks when accessing it (compare `OPCODE_STORE_GLOBAL` vs `OPCODE_STORE_NAMED_GLOBAL`).\r\n\r\nIf named globals turn out to be a bottleneck for extension interop, we can certainly optimize it. It still needs validity checks or recompilation of dependent scripts though. `global_array` simply does not provide that.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5016255966/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]